[size=5][b][color=#f59e0b]The Full Preference List[/color][/b][/size]

Every preference below maps to one vanilla statistic, grouped as they appear on the New Bond page. The number is its point weight: each time the statistic increases by one, an active follower gains that many points if she likes it or loses that many if she hates it. Profiles accept either the label or the [font=Courier New]ROM_*[/font] identifier.

